#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/virtual-cam.rst:32
msgid "**Running a virtual-cam Project**"
msgstr "**运行 virtual-cam 项目**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/virtual-cam.rst:34
msgid ""
"The virtual-cam will read images from a directory specified by the "
"CC3_VCAM_PATH environment variable. The path should be relative to the "
"directory where the virtual-cam executable is called. For example in a bash "
"terminal you might run a virtual-cam file like:"
msgstr ""
"virtual-cam 将从 CC3_VCAM_PATH 环境变量指定的目录读取图像。该路径应相对于调用 virtual-cam "
"可执行文件的目录。例如，在 bash 终端中，您可能会像这样运行一个 virtual-cam 文件："

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/virtual-cam.rst:48
msgid ""
"The virtual-cam directory contains sample images that will be fed into the "
"virtual camera frame buffer. The images need to be in PPM format and "
"numbered \"IMGxxxxx.PPM\" where the x's represent the frame number. The "
"virtual-cam hal will read in images each time cc3_load_frame() is called in "
"increasing order starting from \"IMG00000.PPM\". Once no more images are "
"available, the virtual-hal will panic and stop. These images can be created "
"using the ppm-grab project. By default, the **ppm-grab project** stores raw,"
" high resolution, uncompressed images in the correct format to be used by "
"the virtual-cam hal."
msgstr ""
"virtual-cam 目录包含将被馈入虚拟相机帧缓冲区的示例图像。图像必须为 PPM 格式，并编号为\"IMGxxxxx.PPM\"，其中 x "
"表示帧编号。每次调用 cc3_load_frame() 时，virtual-cam hal "
"将按从\"IMG00000.PPM\"开始的递增顺序读取图像。一旦没有更多可用图像，virtual-hal 将崩溃并停止。这些图像可以使用 ppm-"
"grab 项目创建。默认情况下，\\ **ppm-grab 项目** 以正确的格式存储原始、高分辨率、未压缩的图像，供 virtual-cam hal "
"使用。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/virtual-cam.rst:57
msgid "**Simulation Issues**"
msgstr "**仿真问题**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/virtual-cam.rst:59
